---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact | Fabriant
description: Start with a free Azure assessment. Tell us which subscription or workload worries you most and we reply within one business day.
hideCtaBand: true
---
      <section id="contact" class="page-top">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h1>Start with a free Azure assessment</h1>
          <p>Tell us which subscription or workload worries you most: a release, a bill, an audit or a backlog. We reply within one business day to agree a start date for your 1-week assessment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-layout">
          <div class="contact-intro">
            <h3>What happens next</h3>
            <ol class="next-steps">
              <li>We reply within one business day.</li>
              <li>A 30-minute discussion to pick a suitable workload and confirm the starting scope.</li>
              <li>Your one-week assessment starts, with read-only access.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="contact-email">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Enquiry%20from%20website">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
          </div>
          <form class="contact-form" id="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" action="/contact/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company-website">
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
            <p class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
              <label>Leave this empty <input name="company-website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            </p>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="contact-name">Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="contact-name" name="name" placeholder="Your full name" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="contact-email">Work email</label>
              <input type="email" id="contact-email" name="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="contact-company">Company</label>
              <input type="text" id="contact-company" name="company" placeholder="Company name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="contact-topic">What do you need help with?</label>
              <select id="contact-topic" name="topic">
                {%- for topic in site.topics %}
                <option data-slug="{{ topic.slug }}">{{ topic.label }}</option>
                {%- endfor %}
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="contact-message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your Azure environment and what is hurting…"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="form-submit" id="contact-submit">
              Send message
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/>
              </svg>
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </section>
